sequenceDiagram
    participant Client as HTTP Client<br/>(Data Scientist / SDK)
    participant Gunicorn as Gunicorn/Uvicorn<br/>WSGI/ASGI Server
    participant Flask as Flask Application<br/>Port 5000
    participant Auth as kubernetes-auth Plugin<br/>mlflow-kubernetes-plugins
    participant Handlers as Route Handlers<br/>(Tracking / Registry / Artifacts)
    participant K8sAPI as Kubernetes API<br/>Workspace Store
    participant SQL as SQL Backend<br/>(Backend Store URI)
    participant S3 as Artifact Storage<br/>(S3 / GCS / Azure)

    Note over Client, S3: Inbound Request Flow

    Client->>Gunicorn: HTTP/HTTPS Request<br/>Port 5000
    Gunicorn->>Flask: Forward to WSGI/ASGI app
    Flask->>Auth: Intercept for authentication<br/>--app-name kubernetes-auth
    Auth->>K8sAPI: Validate credentials<br/>via Kubernetes API
    K8sAPI-->>Auth: Authentication result
    Auth-->>Flask: Authenticated request

    alt Tracking API Request
        Flask->>Handlers: /ajax-api/3.0/mlflow/*<br/>Experiment/Run operations
        Handlers->>SQL: Store/retrieve metadata<br/>SQLAlchemy
        SQL-->>Handlers: Query results
        Handlers-->>Flask: JSON response
    else Model Registry Request
        Flask->>Handlers: /{name}/versions/*<br/>Model CRUD operations
        Handlers->>SQL: Store/retrieve model metadata
        SQL-->>Handlers: Query results
        Handlers-->>Flask: JSON response
    else Artifact Serving Request
        Flask->>Handlers: Artifact download<br/>--serve-artifacts enabled
        Handlers->>S3: Fetch artifact<br/>HTTPS (boto3 / GCS SDK / Azure SDK)
        S3-->>Handlers: Artifact data
        Handlers-->>Flask: Artifact response
    end

    Flask-->>Gunicorn: Response
    Gunicorn-->>Client: HTTP/HTTPS Response

    Note over Client, S3: Workspace Operations

    Client->>Gunicorn: Workspace request<br/>--enable-workspaces
    Gunicorn->>Flask: Forward
    Flask->>Auth: Authenticate
    Auth-->>Flask: OK
    Flask->>K8sAPI: kubernetes:// workspace store<br/>Read/write workspace state
    K8sAPI-->>Flask: Workspace data
    Flask-->>Gunicorn: Response
    Gunicorn-->>Client: Workspace response

    Note over Client, S3: Kubernetes Project Execution (Optional)

    Client->>Gunicorn: Run MLflow Project
    Gunicorn->>Flask: Forward
    Flask->>Handlers: Project execution request
    Handlers->>K8sAPI: Create Kubernetes Job<br/>mlflow/projects/kubernetes.py
    K8sAPI-->>Handlers: Job created
    loop Poll Job Status
        Handlers->>K8sAPI: Check Job status
        K8sAPI-->>Handlers: Status update
    end
    Handlers-->>Flask: Execution result
    Flask-->>Gunicorn: Response
    Gunicorn-->>Client: Project result
